        "$\\Delta'=m^2-m+3>0$ luôn đúng. $x_1+x_2=2m$, $x_1x_2=m-3$. $\\dfrac1{x_1}+\\dfrac1{x_2}=\\dfrac{2m}{m-3}=\\dfrac32 \\Rightarrow 4m=3m-9 \\Rightarrow m=-9$ (thoả $m\\ne3$). Chọn D."
      ]
    },
